  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HEARD - Health of Ethiopian Animals for Rural Development - Component 1 Oromia National Regional state Livestock and Fisheries Resources Development Bureau</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;In line with the framework of the HEARD, this proposed project is designed to implement the planned activities under HEARD Result 1 The quality of public and private veterinary services strengthened and delivery optimised through the creation of an enabled and rationalised environment to be implemented by three regional states (Oromia, Amhara and Somali)&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
